:: FindStolenPanties [nobr] {"position":"4225,950","size":"100,100"}
/* Recovery beat for a single stolen-panties pin. Each garment is
   stashed + restored independently now (see stashStolenClothes), so
   the four FindStolen* passages each undo just their own piece and
   stamp their own clothesStolen<Piece> kind as collected. */
@@.mc-thoughts; Your stolen panties, balled up in the furniture.@@<br>
<br>
<<if setup.Mc.exhibitionism() gte 5>>
	@@.mc-speech; Or... maybe I shouldn't put them back on... I've kind of gotten used to being naked...<br>
	I can pick them up later. Hopefully, they won't disappear...@@<br>

	<<linkreplace "@@.mc-speechLink; Nah... I should get dressed@@">>
		<br>
		@@.mc-action; You slip your panties back on.@@<br><br>
		<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("panties")>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<<else>>
	@@.mc-action; You slip your panties back on.@@<br><br>
	<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("panties")>>
<</if>>
<<run setup.HuntController.takeLoot("clothesStolenPanties")>>

:: FindStolenBra [nobr] {"position":"4325,950","size":"100,100"}
@@.mc-thoughts; Your stolen bra, balled up in the furniture.@@<br>
<br>
<<if setup.Mc.exhibitionism() gte 5>>
	@@.mc-speech; Or... I could stay topless under this. I've kind of gotten used to it...@@<br>

	<<linkreplace "@@.mc-speechLink; Nah... I should put it back on@@">>
		<br>
		@@.mc-action; You fasten the bra back on.@@<br><br>
		<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("bra")>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<<else>>
	@@.mc-action; You fasten the bra back on.@@<br><br>
	<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("bra")>>
<</if>>
<<run setup.HuntController.takeLoot("clothesStolenBra")>>

:: FindStolenShirt [nobr] {"position":"4425,950","size":"100,100"}
@@.mc-thoughts; Your stolen top, balled up in the furniture.@@<br>
<br>
<<if setup.Mc.exhibitionism() gte 5>>
	@@.mc-speech; Or... I could keep going without it. I've kind of gotten used to it...@@<br>

	<<linkreplace "@@.mc-speechLink; Nah... I should put it back on@@">>
		<br>
		@@.mc-action; You pull the top back on.@@<br><br>
		<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("shirt")>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<<else>>
	@@.mc-action; You pull the top back on.@@<br><br>
	<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("shirt")>>
<</if>>
<<run setup.HuntController.takeLoot("clothesStolenShirt")>>

:: FindStolenBottom [nobr] {"position":"4525,950","size":"100,100"}
@@.mc-thoughts; Your stolen bottoms, balled up in the furniture.@@<br>
<br>
<<if setup.Mc.exhibitionism() gte 5>>
	@@.mc-speech; Or... maybe I leave them off. I've kind of gotten used to walking around bare...@@<br>

	<<linkreplace "@@.mc-speechLink; Nah... I should get dressed@@">>
		<br>
		@@.mc-action; You step back into your bottoms.@@<br>
		<<set _vid to setup.Wardrobe.findStolenDressupVideo()>>
		<<if _vid>>
			<<video _vid "displayCentredImgs">>
		<</if>>
		<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("bottom")>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<<else>>
	@@.mc-action; You step back into your bottoms.@@<br>
	<<set _vid to setup.Wardrobe.findStolenDressupVideo()>>
	<<if _vid>>
		<<video _vid "displayCentredImgs">>
	<</if>>
	<<run setup.Wardrobe.restoreGarment("bottom")>>
<</if>>
<<run setup.HuntController.takeLoot("clothesStolenBottom")>>
